const FELICIA = {"name": "菲利希亚", "title": "第三十六魂 · 群灵之冠 · 永驻者", "abil": "<p><strong>三十六魂之冠（常驻）。</strong>你持杖时获得 +2 命中与 +2 伤害；你的德鲁伊法术命中检定 +2、法术豁免DC +2。</p><p><strong>群灵主持（常驻）。</strong>每日的通灵由菲利希亚主持，她始终在场，不占用苏醒名额。</p><p><strong>慈母庇护（每日一次 · 反应）。</strong>当你或30尺内一个你能看见的友方将要降至0生命值时，你可以用反应令其改为停在1生命值，并获得等同你德鲁伊等级的临时生命值。</p><p><strong>转生术（每日一次）。</strong>你可无需任何构材施展转生术（Reincarnate）。</p>"};
const FS="world", F_DRAW="laurelDraw", F_OVER="laurelOver", F_ECHO="laurelEcho", ITEM_FLAG="laurelAncestor";
const OFFER_COST=100;
const OVERNOTE='<p><em>此为越界呼唤的先祖：越界召唤本身消耗一个附赠动作；其能力按本条目所述的动作消耗与用量发动。</em></p>';

function usesFor(lim){const lr=[{period:"lr",type:"recoverAll"}],sr=[{period:"sr",type:"recoverAll"}];switch(lim){
  case"mod":return{spent:0,max:"@abilities.wis.mod",recovery:lr};case"prof":return{spent:0,max:"@prof",recovery:lr};
  case"cap2":return{spent:0,max:"2",recovery:lr};case"cap3":return{spent:0,max:"3",recovery:lr};
  case"ws":return{spent:0,max:"1",recovery:sr};case"day1":return{spent:0,max:"1",recovery:lr};
  default:return{spent:0,max:"",recovery:[]};}}
function fullName(a){return a.code+"·"+a.name+"  "+a.en;}
const getEcho=(ac)=>ac.getFlag(FS,F_ECHO)||0;
const getDraw=(ac)=>ac.getFlag(FS,F_DRAW)||[];
const getOver=(ac)=>ac.getFlag(FS,F_OVER)||[];
function cleanRoll(s){return (s||"").replace(/\[\[\/r\s*([^\]]+)\]\]/g,"$1");}

// 数据层：优先模板角色，找不到用内置
async function ensureTemplate(){
  if(game.actors.getName(TPL_NAME)) return true;
  for(const pack of game.packs){
    if(pack.documentName!=="Actor") continue;
    try{ const idx=await pack.getIndex();
      const entry=idx.find(e=>e.name===TPL_NAME);
      if(entry){ await game.actors.importFromCompendium(pack, entry._id);
        ui.notifications.info("已从合集包「"+pack.metadata.label+"」导入先祖模板到当前世界。"); return true; }
    }catch(e){ console.warn("laurel ensureTemplate",e); }
  }
  return false;
}
function ancEntries(){
  const t=game.actors.getName(TPL_NAME);
  if(t){const fs=t.items.filter(it=>it.getFlag(FS,ITEM_FLAG));
    if(fs.length) return fs.map(it=>{const m=it.getFlag(FS,"laurelMeta")||{};
      return {code:m.code,name:m.name,en:m.en,lim:m.lim,desc:it.system?.description?.value||"",doc:it};});}
  return ANCESTORS.map(a=>({code:a.code,name:a.name,en:a.en,lim:a.lim,desc:a.desc,data:a}));
}
function makeData(e,over){
  if(e.doc){ const d=e.doc.toObject(); delete d._id;
    foundry.utils.setProperty(d,"flags."+FS+"."+ITEM_FLAG,true);
    foundry.utils.setProperty(d,"flags."+FS+".over",!!over);
    if(over){ d.name=fullName(e)+"（越界）"; const v=(d.system?.description?.value)||""; foundry.utils.setProperty(d,"system.description.value",v+OVERNOTE); }
    return d;
  }
  const a=e.data; const acts={}; if(a.act){const ac=foundry.utils.deepClone(a.act);acts[ac._id]=ac;}
  const flags={[FS]:{[ITEM_FLAG]:true,laurelMeta:{code:a.code,name:a.name,en:a.en,lim:a.lim},over:!!over}};
  if(a.cpr) flags["chris-premades"]=foundry.utils.deepClone(a.cpr);
  if(a.aa) flags["autoanimations"]=foundry.utils.deepClone(a.aa);
  return {name:fullName(a)+(over?"（越界）":""),type:"feat",img:a.img,
    system:{description:{value:a.desc+(over?OVERNOTE:"")},uses:usesFor(a.lim),type:{value:""},activities:acts},
    effects:[...(a.effects||[]),...(a.xeffects||[])], flags};
}
async function clearFeats(actor){const ids=actor.items.filter(it=>it.getFlag(FS,ITEM_FLAG)).map(it=>it.id);if(ids.length)await actor.deleteEmbeddedDocuments("Item",ids);}

async function doCommune(actor){
  const echo=getEcho(actor),n=Math.max(0,3-echo);
  await clearFeats(actor);
  const pool=ancEntries(),p=[...pool],drawn=[];
  for(let i=0;i<n&&p.length;i++)drawn.push(p.splice(Math.floor(Math.random()*p.length),1)[0]);
  if(drawn.length)await actor.createEmbeddedDocuments("Item",drawn.map(e=>makeData(e,false)));
  await actor.setFlag(FS,F_DRAW,drawn.map(e=>e.code));
  await actor.setFlag(FS,F_OVER,[]);
  const list=drawn.map(e=>'<b>'+e.code+'·'+e.name+'</b>').join('、')||'<i>无人应召</i>';
  const flavor=n===0?'群声喧嚣，先祖们各执其声，今日竟无人应你而醒——你只能越界相求了。':('月桂顶端的星辰次第睁眼，'+drawn.length+'位先祖随你同行。');
  ChatMessage.create({speaker:ChatMessage.getSpeaker({actor}),content:'<div style="font-family:Signika,sans-serif;background:#0d1f12;border:2px solid #2e7d32;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 12px;color:#d7f5dd;"><div style="color:#7be89a;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:5px;">群灵议会 · 今日通灵</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;">'+flavor+'</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;margin-top:6px;">回响 <b>'+echo+'</b>　·　今日苏醒 <b>'+n+'</b> 位：'+list+'</div></div>'});
  openWheel(actor);
}
async function doOverdraw(actor,code){
  const pool=ancEntries(),e=pool.find(x=>x.code===code);if(!e)return;
  const draw=getDraw(actor),over=getOver(actor);
  if(draw.includes(code)){ui.notifications.info(e.code+"·"+e.name+" 今日已苏醒，无需越界。");return;}
  if(over.includes(code)){ui.notifications.warn("你今日已越界呼唤过 "+e.code+"·"+e.name+"，同一位先祖不能重复呼唤。");return;}
  await actor.createEmbeddedDocuments("Item",[makeData(e,true)]);
  over.push(code);await actor.setFlag(FS,F_OVER,over);
  const echo=getEcho(actor)+1;await actor.setFlag(FS,F_ECHO,echo);
  ChatMessage.create({speaker:ChatMessage.getSpeaker({actor}),content:'<div style="font-family:Signika,sans-serif;background:#160d20;border:2px solid #6a4fb0;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 12px;color:#e7d7f5;"><div style="color:#c4a9ff;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:5px;">越界 · 呼唤沉睡的先祖</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;">'+actor.name+'以一个附赠动作越过苏醒的界限，将沉睡的 <b>'+e.code+'·'+e.name+'</b> 唤到场前。你随后可按其能力本身的动作消耗发动它一次。</div><div style="font-size:12px;margin-top:6px;color:#b39ddb;">回响 +1（当前 <b>'+echo+'</b>）。明日苏醒将少一位；回响需于长休祭祀先祖以消解。</div></div>'});
  openWheel(actor);
}
async function doOffer(actor){
  const echo=getEcho(actor);
  if(echo<=0){ui.notifications.info("当前没有回响需要消解。");return;}
  const gp=actor.system?.currency?.gp||0;
  new Dialog({title:"祭祀先祖",content:'<div style="font-family:Signika,sans-serif;background:#0d1f12;color:#d7f5dd;border-radius:6px;padding:12px;"><p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12.5px;color:#9bcfa6;">此举应在一次<strong>长休</strong>期间进行：你向月桂献上自然的祭品，安抚被你借声的群灵。</p><p style="margin:6px 0;">当前回响：<b>'+echo+'</b>　·　持有金币：<b>'+gp+' GP</b></p><p style="margin:6px 0;font-size:12.5px;">每消解 1 点回响，献上价值 <b>'+OFFER_COST+'GP</b> 的自然祭品。</p><div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px;"><label>消解点数：</label><input type="number" id="of-pts" value="'+echo+'" min="1" max="'+echo+'" style="width:84px;text-align:center;color:#eafff0;background:#0a1810;border:1px solid #3a7a4a;border-radius:4px;padding:3px 0;"></div></div>',buttons:{ok:{icon:'<i class="fas fa-leaf"></i>',label:"献祭",callback:async(h)=>{let pts=parseInt(h.find("#of-pts").val())||0;pts=Math.max(0,Math.min(echo,pts));if(pts<=0)return;const cost=pts*OFFER_COST;if(gp<cost){ui.notifications.error("金币不足：需要 "+cost+" GP，仅有 "+gp+" GP。");return;}await actor.update({"system.currency.gp":gp-cost});await actor.setFlag(FS,F_ECHO,echo-pts);ChatMessage.create({speaker:ChatMessage.getSpeaker({actor}),content:'<div style="font-family:Signika,sans-serif;background:#0d1f12;border:2px solid #2e7d32;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;color:#d7f5dd;"><div style="color:#7be89a;font-weight:bold;margin-bottom:4px;">祭祀先祖</div><div style="font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.6;">'+actor.name+'献上价值 '+cost+'GP 的自然祭品，群声渐息。回响 −'+pts+'（当前 <b>'+(echo-pts)+'</b>）。</div></div>'});openWheel(actor);}},cancel:{icon:'<i class="fas fa-times"></i>',label:"取消"}},default:"ok"},{width:360}).render(true);
}

